'''Arboliva''' (Japanese: '''オリーヴァ''' ''Oliva'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

